    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf59 The Onigiri is on the Run!</strong><br>An onigiri has escaped from a convenience store shelf, heading for the land of freedom!<br>Become the \u201crunning rice ball\u201d and dash full speed through the city!<br>It\u2019s a simple-to-play running game\u2014see how far you can make it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude97 Watch Out for Obstacles!</strong><br>Cars, guardrails, street trees...<br>Everything is a deadly trap for a tiny onigiri!<br>Dodge with perfect timing and keep on rolling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2764\ufe0f Umeboshi = Lifeline</strong><br>The longer you run, the more your stamina drains\u2026<br>Grab umeboshi (pickled plums) along the way to stay energized and keep going!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf06 The Route Changes Every Run!</strong><br>Stages are procedurally generated, so every playthrough feels fresh.<br>Stay alert and race through ever-changing cityscapes!</p>",
